{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>For the demo version, only the prologue is available. It takes between 15-30 minutes to complete.</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not everything is as it seems.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093170/extras/4a0a89725ac2f0be45451cd5524ad688.poster.avif?t=1761948432\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093170/extras/4a0a89725ac2f0be45451cd5524ad688.webm?t=1761948432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093170/extras/4a0a89725ac2f0be45451cd5524ad688.mp4?t=1761948432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A night that should have been peaceful turns into your worst nightmare. You play a teenager who is left home alone while his parents are away on business. Everything seemed normal... until a dark presence infiltrates your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the Paraguayan legend of Karai Vosa, this evil being lurks in every corner, distorting the safety of your own home and turning it into a labyrinth of fear and tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the night and face the horror that lurks in the shadows?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It stalks you even in your dreams.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093170/extras/ccfd83a3a19635ef566f70592c510caf.poster.avif?t=1761948432\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093170/extras/ccfd83a3a19635ef566f70592c510caf.webm?t=1761948432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093170/extras/ccfd83a3a19635ef566f70592c510caf.mp4?t=1761948432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What were once stories to you have now become reality. Now it will haunt you even in your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive and find a way to free yourself from the curse of the legendary Karai Vosa...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles and memories.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093170/extras/b10022e5eb3320f2fbeec44bf33af1e1.poster.avif?t=1761948432\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093170/extras/b10022e5eb3320f2fbeec44bf33af1e1.webm?t=1761948432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093170/extras/b10022e5eb3320f2fbeec44bf33af1e1.mp4?t=1761948432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate through your memories, there will be puzzles you must complete in order to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let your nerves get the better of you...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person gameplay and immersive environment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive puzzles and riddles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactions with NPCs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating narrative.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093170?t=1761948432","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093170?t=1761948432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co